#1773
The Firenewt Kitchen~
   It is here that the Firenewts prepare their meals and partake of them,
seated at long filthy benches deeply scarred and stained.  Pots and pans bubble
and fry atop a wood-burning cast-iron stove, and from it an Firenewt
occasionally serves himself some rat stew and grits.  The Firenewts in here
seem far too engrossed in their gastronomic acitivities to notice your
presence, though doubtless they would react strongly were you to disturb their
meals.    
~
